'''Mesmer [[Tyrian armor]]''' is an art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign and is also available in the Factions campaign and Eye of the North expansion. This armor is called '''Stylish''' up to maximum armor level in Droknar's Forge where it is instead called Tyrian armor.

'''Note''': Mesmer Tyrian armor art does not have headgear, but the [[Mesmer Animal Mask|Animal]] and [[mesmer Imposing Mask|Imposing]] masks are available from the same armorer in Factions and Eye of the North. Pictures and crafting details are available on that page.

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Tyrian armor.

